{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"e4cb76eb001bedee","type":"group","x":-1070,"y":-810,"width":3350,"height":1620,"label":"Metadata on data"},
		{"id":"6c326bf14fd23f24","type":"group","x":-1050,"y":-690,"width":3290,"height":960,"label":"Structured"},
		{"id":"b7c8244937fc9898","type":"text","text":"### Metadata for Data (structured)\n### dataset\n```json\n{\n\"dataset_id\": \"<UUID>\",\n\"dataset_system_id\": \"<UUID>\",\n\"dataset_name\": \"<logical_name>\",\n\"dataset_type\": \"structured\",\n\"layout_type\": \"single_table|multi_sheet\",\n\"file_extension\": \"csv|xlsx|xls|parquet\",\n\"has_header\": true,\n\"schema_version\": 1,\n\"status\": \"active\",\n\"dataset_path\": \"\",\n\"ssot_system\": true,\n\"format_specifiers\": {\n\"dataset_fields\": [\"string\", \"string\"],\n\"dataset_field_count\": 5,\n},\n\"possible_primary_key\": [],\n\"possible_foreign_key\": [],\n\"embedding_input\": \"\",\n\"created_at\": \"<timestamp>\",\n\"created_by\": \"\",  //string data-type\n\"updated_at\": \"<timestamp>\",\n\"updated_by\": \"\",  //string data-type\n}\n```","x":-440,"y":-630,"width":620,"height":780},
		{"id":"3cb7e2b89b622078","type":"text","text":"### Metadata for Data (structured)\n\n#### dataset system\n\n```json\n{\n  \"dataset_system_id\": \"<UUID>\",\n  \"dataset_system_name\": \"<logical_name>\",\n  \"dataset_system_type\": \"structured|unstrucred\",\n  \"datasets\": [\n    {\n      \"dataset_id\": \"<UUID>\",\n      \"dataset_name\": \"<logical_dataset_name>\",\n    },\n    {\n      \"dataset_id\": \"<UUID>\",\n      \"dataset_name\": \"<logical_dataset_name>\",\n    }\n  ],\n  \"status\": \"active|inactive|deprecated\",\n  \"schema_version\": 1,\n  \"embedding_input\": \"\",\n  \"created_at\": \"<timestamp>\",\n  \"created_by\": \"\",\n  \"updated_at\": \"<timestamp>\",\n  \"updated_by\": \"\"\n}\n \n```","x":-1000,"y":-630,"width":502,"height":740},
		{"id":"dc14ad5e47759294","type":"text","text":"### Metadata on ELK\n\n```json\n{\n  \"storage_id\": \"grp_001\",\n  \"storage_name\": \"client_001_batch_01\",\n  \"elasticsearch\": {\n    \"hosts\": [\"http://10.0.0.10:9200\"]\n  },\n\n  \"ingestion\": {\n    \"tool\": \"logstash\"\n  },\n\n  \"input_location\": {\n    \"storage_provider\": \"minio\",\n    \"container\": \"datalake\",\n    \"base_path\": \"client_001/source_001/\",\n    \"endpoint\": \"http://minio.company.local:9000\"\n  },\n\n  \"indexes\": [\n    {\n      \"dataset_id\": \"dataset_001\",\n      \"dataset_name\":\"employees\",\n      \"index_name\": \"employees\",\n      \"input_uri\": \"s3://datalake/client_001/source_001/employees.csv\",\n      \"status\": \"active\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"dataset_id\": \"dataset_002\",\n    \"dataset_name\":\"departments\",\n      \"index_name\": \"departments\",\n      \"input_uri\": \"s3://datalake/client_001/source_001/departments.csv\",\n      \"status\": \"active\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"dataset_id\": \"dataset_003\",\n      \"dataset_name\":\"orders\",\n      \"index_name\": \"orders\",\n      \"input_uri\": \"s3://datalake/client_001/source_001/orders.csv\",\n      \"status\": \"active\"\n    }\n  ],\n\n  \"status\": \"active\"\n}\n \n```","x":-2280,"y":-594,"width":800,"height":1240},
		{"id":"f389696445b25f95","type":"text","text":"#### dataset processing\n\n```json\n{\n  \"dataset_id\": \"<UUID>\",\n  \"processing_type\": \"batch/streaming\",\n  \"frequency\": \"hourly\",\n  \"retention_hours\": 720,\n  \"late_arrival_policy\": \"accept\"\n}\n```","x":1520,"y":-642,"width":480,"height":268},
		{"id":"49b15b523d1e32bc","type":"text","text":"#### ml outputs\n\n```json\n{\n  \"dataset_id\": \"ecom_orders\",\n  \"prediction_type\": \"fraud_risk\",\n  \"prediction_value\": \"high\",\n  \"model\": \"fraud_detection_v2\",\n  \"confidence\": 0.89,\n  \"prediction_ts\": \"2026-01-20T12:05:00Z\",\n  \"is_observed\": false\n}\n```","x":1520,"y":-338,"width":480,"height":352},
		{"id":"0c0c4ba72bfd9baf","type":"text","text":"### Metadata for Data (structured)\n\n#### dataset fields\n(one column inside a dataset)\n```json\n\"field_id\": \"<UUID>\",\n\"field_name\": \"<column_name>\",\n\"dataset_id\": \"<UUID>\",\n\"dataset_system_id\": \"<UUID>\"\n\"sensitivity\": {},\n\"status\": \"active\",\n\"field_type\": \"structured\"\n\"is_possible_foreign_key\": false,\n\"is_possible_primary_key\": false,\n\"field_stats\": {\n\t\"is_unique\": true,\n\t\"nullable\": true,\n\t\"sample_values\": [],\n\t\"data_type\": \"string|integer|decimal|date|timestamp|boolean\",\n\t\"record_counts\": 500,\n\t\"null_counts\": 20\n}\n\"embedding_input\": \"\",\n\"created_at\": \"<timestamp>\",\n\"created_by\": \"\",  //string data-type\n\"updated_at\": \"<timestamp>\",\n\"updated_by\": \"\",  //string data-type\n```","x":240,"y":-630,"width":660,"height":702},
		{"id":"7790f8226234679c","type":"text","text":"### Metadata for Data (structured)\n\n#### dataset relationship\n\n```json\n\"relationship_id\": \"<UUID>\",\n\"source\": {   //table-table, table-column\n\t\"storage_id\": \"<UUID>\",\n\t\"storage_name\": \"<storage name>\",\n\t\"field_id\": \"<UUID>\",\n\t\"field_name\": \"<field name>\",\n},\n\"target\": {\n\t\"storage_id\": \"<UUID>\",\n\t\"storage_name\": \"<storage name>\",\n\t\"field_id\": \"<UUID>\",\n\t\"field_name\": \"<field name>\",\n},\n\"relationship_scope\": \"Intra/Inter\",\n\"relationship\": \"foreign_key\",\n\"relationship_type\": \"one-to-one\",\n\"embedding_input\": \"\",\n\"confidence_score\": 0.85,\n\"created_at\": \"<timestamp>\",\n\"created_by\": \"\",  //string data-type\n\"updated_at\": \"<timestamp>\",\n\"updated_by\": \"\",  //string data-type\n```","x":960,"y":-630,"width":524,"height":690}
	],
	"edges":[]
}